    featuredImageDescription: "Editorial hero image for Quantum Security in Global Finance: Preparing Transactional Networks for the Next Decade of Cryptography",
    keywords: ["quantum computing", "post-quantum cryptography", "financial infrastructure", "crypto-agility", "transactional security", "Priv"],
